# "Creatures you control have haste." Bot1 casts Mox Ruby/Pearl/Emerald, Samut ({1}{R}) and Llanowar Elves ({G}) on turn 1 and attacks
# with both at once: Samut himself and the Elves have haste, so Bot2 takes 2 + 1. On turn 2 Bot2 (no Samut of its own; his
# haste is for his controller's creatures only) casts its own Llanowar Elves and is still summoning sick (no haste); the control is Bot1's
# attack above with the same creature. (The engine asks Bot2 nothing when no creature can attack, so this is read off the state.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Samut, Hazoret's Champion
Llanowar Elves
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Island x15

